stdout:
reference[18]: Preview by default. --confirm reclaims on owner dead OR expiry. Unknown owners,"are retained unless expired. Foreign-machine leases are always retained, even",when expired. Failed cleanup retains its lease. No unleased resources are touched.,Run this command from a host timer for automatic reclamation; no daemon runs.,"Examples:","  dibs sweep","  dibs sweep --confirm --json","Output: --axi for agents, --json for scripts (mutually exclusive).","Default: human on terminals; AXI for pipes or DIBS_AXI=1.","Lease commands: --full restores complete AXI records/text; JSON is always complete.","","Exit codes: 0 success (including no-ops), 1 operation failed, 2 invalid usage.","dibs job: child's exit code on completion; 124 deadline killed child;",75 (EX_TEMPFAIL) no slot within wait. Dibs's own 1/2 apply only when no child,was started. Signal termination returns 128 + signal number. Helper/wait,failures after start use 125/126 and diagnostics on stderr.,76 is SSH transport/protocol failure with unknown remote result (stderr).,Child exit 255 is preserved and is not confused with SSH failure.
usage: "dibs sweep [--confirm] [--machine NAME] [--json]"
